    {
      "name": "a-stealth-category-row-alone-is-a-complete-action",
      "note": "A world that authored no stealth columns at all still has stealth actions: a row the creator filed under `stealth` IS one, and its energyCost is charged out of the same meter a swing is paid from. The `chore` row beside it is not loaded — one action block, and stealth reads the rows that are already in it.",
